{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>They have set upon me</b> — like שׁוֹת, שָׁתוּ is a pluralis tantum [noun functioning as plural], like נִלְחָמוּ. And some interpreted: [it means] foundations, and the sense is like רְשֵׁתוֹת, therefore the word סָבִיב."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:15.462032999Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}